 "summary": "A 22 µF ±20% multilayer ceramic chip capacitor with a high-dielectric-constant X5R dielectric, rated 35 V, in the 3.2 × 2.5 mm case (EIA 1210, JIS 3225) with a 2.5 mm thickness. It works from -55 to +85 °C and is meant for reflow soldering. It belongs to Taiyo Yuden's general electronic equipment category and was formerly sold as GMK325BJ226MM-P. Typical curves give capacitance against frequency, DC bias and temperature, impedance and ESR against frequency, and self-heating against ripple current.",
